+## 2b. Living-world extension `livingWorld@1` (PROPOSED 2026-10-04, additive)
+
+Both directions carry one optional block. An engine that ignores it still runs a correct canon battle.
+
+- **Allocate** `livingWorld` (POI battles only): `{ v: 1, poiId, lwKind, threat, ground, hexTerrain,
+  terrainMods: { attacker, defender }, garrisonStats, mapId, eventDeck: [{ event, atSec | trigger: 'FIRST_CONTACT',
+  teleSec, arrival?: { via: ArrivalVia, spawn, target } }], defence: { rating, ratingMax }, floorSec,
+  guardian?: { form, nftId, owner, battleHp, shieldsCore, damageShareMax: 0.2, bombard, aura, ascended?, stationEndsTick } }`.
+- **Result** `livingWorld`: `{ guardianOutcome?: GuardianOutcome }`. It settles the Guardian bounty escrow: KO /
+  UNBOUND → all to the attackers, OUTLASTED → half, HELD → untouched.
+- Builder and resolver: `etherfantasy-clashfront` `tools/living-world/allocate_payload.mjs` and `resolve_result.mjs`
+  (idempotent on `battleId`; a conflicting `matchId` is a 409; officer impact is clamped to `HERO_IMPACT_MAX`).
+
 ## 3. HMAC provisioning & signing
 
 - Header: `X-CF-Signature: v1=<hex(hmacSHA256(secret, rawRequestBody))>` + `X-CF-Key-Id: cf-hmac-1`.
